cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "E-Field Lab"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, and also cite SimNIBS."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Jones
    given-names: Sylar Robert
    affiliation: Omega Dynamics
repository-code: "https://github.com/Omega-Collective/omega-efield-lab"
url: "https://omegadym.com/efield"
abstract: >-
  Browser-based simulation of the electric field induced on the cortex by
  transcranial electric stimulation montages. Built on a precomputed SimNIBS
  leadfield and linear superposition, so any montage over the 10-10 system is
  evaluated instantly and without installation.
keywords:
  - transcranial electric stimulation
  - tDCS
  - electric field modelling
  - SimNIBS
  - neuromodulation
